+# BP-068 — Menu lifecycle parity
+
+- `togglemenu` now returns from submenus to the main menu before closing.
+- Removes the duplicate `M_Menu_Save_f` invocation in the host command adapter.
+- Uses WinQuake's full-unit CD-volume option step.
+- Adds 22 MiniLang fixtures, a C oracle, golden data and a static checker.
