+# BP-068 menu lifecycle audit
+
+Compared paths: `menu.c::M_ToggleMenu_f`, `M_Menu_Save_f`, and `M_AdjustSliders`.
+Submenu toggles return to main, save entry is dispatched once, and the Windows CD-volume slider uses the original full-unit step.
